 "texts": [
  {
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 3.0,
   "fi": 0,
   "html": "<div class='h1'>Even the bravest people hit a wall.</div>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 3.2,
   "t1": 6.4,
   "html": "<p class='t'>Elijah was one of the greatest prophets in the Bible.</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 6.6,
   "t1": 10.8,
   "html": "<p class='t'>He stood alone against 450 prophets of Baal, and God answered him with fire from heaven.</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 11.2,
   "t1": 13.6,
   "html": "<div class='h1'>Then one message broke him.</div>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 13.8,
   "t1": 16.5,
   "html": "<p class='t'>Queen Jezebel swore to kill him by the next day.</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 16.9,
   "t1": 20.3,
   "html": "<p class='t'>So he ran for his life, deep into the desert.</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.7,
   "t1": 25.3,
   "html": "<p class='t'>After a day’s walk, he sat down under a tree and told God, “It is enough.”</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 25.7,
   "t1": 29.3,
   "html": "<p class='t'>He fell asleep there. An angel touched him: “Get up and eat.”</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 29.5,
   "t1": 32.9,
   "html": "<p class='t'>Beside his head: bread baked on hot coals, and a jar of water.</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 33.1,
   "t1": 35.4,
   "html": "<p class='t'>He ate, drank, and lay down again.</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 35.6,
   "t1": 40.9,
   "html": "<p class='t'>The angel came back a second time:</p><div class='v' style='margin-top:26px'>“Arise and eat, because the journey is too great for you.”</div><div class='r'>1 Kings 19:7</div>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.3,
   "t1": 45.3,
   "html": "<div class='h1'>God didn’t lecture him. He fed him and let him rest.</div>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 45.7,
   "t1": 49.3,
   "html": "<p class='t'>With that strength, he walked 40 days to the mountain of God.</p>"
  },
  {
   "t0": 49.5,
   "t1": 58.4,
   "html": "<div class='h1'>Worn out today? Start where God started with Elijah: sleep, and a good meal.</div>"
  },
